      "investigation": "Montevideo's own Municipio B page (fetched) states Tue/Thu/Sat 15:00–17:00 tours booked by phone/Facebook at UYU 200. Multiple independent tour aggregators (GetYourGuide, descubrimontevideo.uy, Trip.com) converge on a different, more granular grid — Mon–Fri 10:30/12:00/14:00/16:30 (ES) plus English times, Sat 10:00/10:30/12:00, Sun 12:00/14:00 — booked exclusively through Red Ticket, no door sales. Fetching Red Ticket's own event listing directly confirmed an active, currently-selling event (Aug 24, 2026, 10:30, Spanish, with more times available), which corroborates the Red-Ticket-based system as the CURRENT one and the Municipio B page as stale content still live on a government domain.",
